{"slug":"/students/subjects/mathematics/statistics-probability/representation-data/","source":"students/subjects/mathematics/statistics-probability/representation-data.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Representation of Data — Charts & Tables","description":"","subject":"mathematics","body":"<header class=\"bg-emerald-700 text-white py-3 mb-6\"><div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"font-semibold\">Representation of Data</div><a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/statistics-probability/\" class=\"text-white/90\">Back</a></div></header>\n\n  <main class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-6\">\n    <section class=\"card\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Which chart to use?</h2><div class=\"muted mt-2\">Use bar charts for categorical comparisons, histograms for continuous frequency, pie for proportions, and tables for exact counts.</div></section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Histogram (example)</h2>\n      <div class=\"mt-3 muted text-sm\">Histogram for numeric data shows bins and frequency heights.</div>\n      <div class=\"mt-4 flex justify-center\">\n        <!-- simple histogram SVG -->\n        <svg width=\"340\" height=\"120\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n          <rect x=\"30\" y=\"50\" width=\"40\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#93c5fd\"></rect>\n          <rect x=\"80\" y=\"30\" width=\"40\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#60a5fa\"></rect>\n          <rect x=\"130\" y=\"10\" width=\"40\" height=\"90\" fill=\"#3b82f6\"></rect>\n          <rect x=\"180\" y=\"60\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#2563eb\"></rect>\n          <rect x=\"230\" y=\"80\" width=\"40\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#1e40af\"></rect>\n          <text x=\"30\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#0f172a\">0-10</text>\n          <text x=\"80\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#0f172a\">10-20</text>\n          <text x=\"130\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#0f172a\">20-30</text>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Practice</h2>\n      <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-3\">\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\"><div class=\"font-medium\">1) Frequency table for [1,2,2,3,3,3,4]</div><input id=\"r1\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 1:1,2:2,3:3,4:1\"><div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"rc1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-emerald-700 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"rh1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div><div id=\"rfb1\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div></div>\n\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\"><div class=\"font-medium\">2) Best chart for categorical data?</div><input id=\"r2\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., bar chart\"><div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"rc2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-emerald-700 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"rh2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div><div id=\"rfb2\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"text-right\"><button id=\"rdQuiz\" class=\"bg-emerald-700 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded\">Quick Quiz</button></div>\n  </main>\n\n  <div id=\"rdModal\" class=\"hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black/40 z-40 flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded p-6 max-w-md w-full\"><div id=\"rdContent\"></div><div class=\"mt-4 text-right\"><button id=\"rdClose\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Close</button></div></div></div>\n\n  \n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"bg-emerald-50 font-sans","bodyStyle":"","css":[".card{background:#fff;padding:1rem;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.06)} .muted{color:#374151}"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}